{"seq":3,"slug":"counterfactual","title":"反事实解释","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/explainable-ai/local-methods/counterfactual","wordCount":1742,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"反事实解释\">反事实解释</h1><p><a href=\"shap\">SHAP</a> 告诉被拒贷的申请人「你的负债比贡献了 -0.3 的分数」，但他真正想问的是另一句话：「那我该怎么做才能通过？」归因方法回答「为什么是这个结果」，反事实解释回答「要改什么才能换个结果」。这是一种形态完全不同的局部解释——它给的不是诊断，而是处方。对「解释权」与「补救权」而言，处方往往比诊断更有用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>反事实解释是形态完全不同的局部方法：它不打开黑箱，只在输入空间里找一条最短的「翻盘路径」。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>定义</strong>：寻找一个与原样本尽可能接近、但能让模型给出期望的不同预测的「假想样本」——从诊断变成处方。</li>\n<li><strong>多目标优化</strong>：有效性、邻近性、稀疏性、可行性、多样性同时拉扯，写成优化问题即在「达到目标预测」与「改动尽量小」之间平衡，再叠加约束。</li>\n<li><strong>两条独特风险</strong>：合理 ≠ 忠实（分布外反事实是空中楼阁），以及因果幻觉（模型的反事实不等于现实的因果干预）。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>诉求</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>不满足的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>有效性</td>\n<td>确实翻转了预测</td>\n<td>建议无用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>邻近性</td>\n<td>改动幅度小</td>\n<td>代价高到不可行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稀疏性</td>\n<td>改动特征少</td>\n<td>用户无从下手</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可行性</td>\n<td>现实可达、在流形上</td>\n<td>建议「请把年龄改成 25」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多样性</td>\n<td>给出多条不同路径</td>\n<td>用户无选择余地</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>它与 SHAP/LIME 互补而非竞争：归因回答「谁贡献了这个结果」，反事实回答「改什么能换个结果」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么是反事实\">什么是反事实</h2><p>反事实解释（counterfactual explanation）寻找一个与原样本尽可能接近、但能让模型给出<strong>期望的不同预测</strong>的「假想样本」。对一个被拒的贷款申请 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，反事实就是回答：「如果你的月收入再高 2000 元、信用卡数量减少 1 张，模型就会批准。」它不打开黑箱，只在输入空间里找一条最短的「翻盘路径」。</p>\n<p>它的吸引力在于三点：第一，对终端用户极其友好——不需要懂模型，给出的是可执行的行动建议；第二，天然契合法律语境，欧盟 GDPR 与 AI 法案语境下的「解释权/补救权」要的正是「我能做什么」而非「模型内部如何」（参见<a href=\"../foundations/why-interpretability\">为什么需要可解释性</a>里的合规动机）；第三，它不要求模型可微或简单，模型无关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"优化目标-四个相互拉扯的诉求\">优化目标：四个相互拉扯的诉求</h2><p>找反事实不是随便改几个值翻盘就行，一个有用的反事实要同时满足多个相互冲突的诉求，写成优化问题大致是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mtext>cf</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></munder><mtext> </mtext><munder><munder><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>达到目标预测</mtext></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>改动尽量小</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_{\\text{cf}} = \\arg\\min_{x&#x27;}\\ \\underbrace{\\lambda\\,(f(x&#x27;) - y_{\\text{target}})^2}_{\\text{达到目标预测}} + \\underbrace{d(x, x&#x27;)}_{\\text{改动尽量小}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cf</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4765em;vertical-align:-1.6124em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.356em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6828em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.744em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.3876em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">达到目标预测</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.0659em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9341em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6124em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3782em;vertical-align:-1.5763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">改动尽量小</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 是黑箱，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_{\\text{target}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是期望结果，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d(x,x&#x27;)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是原样本与反事实的距离（衡量改动大小），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 平衡两项。但只有这两项还不够，实务上还要加约束：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>稀疏性（sparsity）</strong>：改动的特征数尽量少——让人改 1 个特征比改 8 个特征可行得多。</li>\n<li><strong>可行性（actionability/plausibility）</strong>：改动必须现实可行，且反事实样本要落在数据流形上（不能建议一个分布外的怪异组合）。</li>\n<li><strong>因果一致性</strong>：尊重特征间的因果关系，比如「降低年龄」「改变种族」这类不可变特征必须冻结，改动一个特征要带动其相关特征。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>诉求</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>不满足的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>有效性</td>\n<td>确实翻转了预测</td>\n<td>建议无用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>邻近性</td>\n<td>改动幅度小</td>\n<td>代价高到不可行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稀疏性</td>\n<td>改动特征少</td>\n<td>用户无从下手</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可行性</td>\n<td>现实可达、在流形上</td>\n<td>建议「请把年龄改成 25」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多样性</td>\n<td>给出多条不同路径</td>\n<td>用户无选择余地</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"dice-与多样化反事实\">DiCE 与多样化反事实</h2><p>只给一条翻盘路径是不够的——也许「月收入 +2000」对某人不可能，但「负债比 -10%」可行。<strong>DiCE（Diverse Counterfactual Explanations）</strong> 是 2026 年广泛使用的工具，它一次生成<strong>多条相互不同</strong>的反事实，覆盖不同的可行改动组合，让用户挑一条自己能走的路。在欧盟 AI 法案背景下，为每个不利决策记录 DiCE 反事实，已被建议纳入部署流水线，与准确率、延迟指标并列（来源：letsdatascience.com/blog/shap-and-lime-making-ai-models-explainable）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    X[被拒样本 x] --&gt; G[搜索反事实]&#10;    G --&gt; C1{约束}&#10;    C1 --&gt; A[达到目标预测]&#10;    C1 --&gt; B[改动小且稀疏]&#10;    C1 --&gt; D[冻结不可变特征]&#10;    C1 --&gt; E[落在数据流形上]&#10;    A --&gt; M[多条候选反事实]&#10;    B --&gt; M&#10;    D --&gt; M&#10;    E --&gt; M&#10;    M --&gt; Out[呈现多样化可行建议]&#10;    Out --&gt; U[用户选一条可执行路径]\">flowchart TD\n    X[被拒样本 x] --&gt; G[搜索反事实]\n    G --&gt; C1{约束}\n    C1 --&gt; A[达到目标预测]\n    C1 --&gt; B[改动小且稀疏]\n    C1 --&gt; D[冻结不可变特征]\n    C1 --&gt; E[落在数据流形上]\n    A --&gt; M[多条候选反事实]\n    B --&gt; M\n    D --&gt; M\n    E --&gt; M\n    M --&gt; Out[呈现多样化可行建议]\n    Out --&gt; U[用户选一条可执行路径]</pre><h2 id=\"反事实-vs-归因-两种解释的分工\">反事实 vs 归因：两种解释的分工</h2><p>反事实和 <a href=\"shap\">SHAP</a>/<a href=\"lime\">LIME</a> 不是竞争关系，而是回答不同问题、面向不同受众的互补工具。</p>\n<p>归因方法（SHAP/LIME）回答「这次预测由哪些特征、各贡献多少」，输出是一组权重，适合调试、审计、向技术团队解释。反事实回答「改什么能换结果」，输出是一组可执行改动，适合向终端用户提供补救建议。一个成熟的解释系统常常二者并用：先用 SHAP 诊断决策依据，再用 DiCE 给出可行动的建议。这与本 hub<a href=\"./\">局部方法引言</a>里强调的「不是三选一」一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱-合理不等于可信\">陷阱：合理不等于可信</h2><p>反事实有一个独特的危险：它太容易让人产生「我理解了模型」的错觉。一条「月收入 +2000 即可批准」的建议听起来无比合理，但它可能完全不忠实——如果反事实样本落在了分布外，黑箱在那个点的预测本身就不可靠，这条建议是空中楼阁。这与 <a href=\"lime\">LIME</a> 的分布外扰动、<a href=\"../global-methods/partial-dependence\">部分依赖</a>的独立性假设是同一个病根，详见<a href=\"../practice/pitfalls\">陷阱与误读</a>。</p>\n<p>另一个坑是<strong>因果幻觉</strong>：反事实描述的是「在模型看来改什么能翻盘」，不是「在现实世界改什么能改变结果」。模型可能依赖了一个非因果的代理变量，照它的反事实去做现实中毫无效果。把模型的反事实当成现实的因果干预，是越界解读。如何量化反事实的有效性与可行性，是<a href=\"../practice/evaluation-trust\">评估与可信度</a>的话题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>反事实回答「改什么能换结果」，给的是处方而非诊断，天然契合解释权/补救权。</li>\n<li>优化目标在「达到目标预测」与「改动尽量小」之间平衡，还要加稀疏、可行、因果一致、不可变特征冻结等约束。</li>\n<li>DiCE 一次生成多条多样化、可行的反事实，让用户挑能走的路；2026 年已被建议纳入高风险系统流水线。</li>\n<li>它与 SHAP/LIME 互补：归因做诊断面向技术团队，反事实做处方面向终端用户，常并用。</li>\n<li>危险在于「合理≠忠实」：分布外反事实是空中楼阁，且模型的反事实不等于现实的因果干预。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"反事实解释","id":"反事实解释"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是反事实","id":"什么是反事实"},{"level":2,"text":"优化目标：四个相互拉扯的诉求","id":"优化目标-四个相互拉扯的诉求"},{"level":2,"text":"DiCE 与多样化反事实","id":"dice-与多样化反事实"},{"level":2,"text":"反事实 vs 归因：两种解释的分工","id":"反事实-vs-归因-两种解释的分工"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱：合理不等于可信","id":"陷阱-合理不等于可信"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"SHAP 沙普利值归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/explainable-ai/local-methods/shap"},"next":{"title":"深度模型解释","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/explainable-ai/practice/deep-learning-interp"}}